{
  "id": "DAN.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "DAN",
  "reference": "Daniel 1",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the third year of the reign of Jehoiakim king of Judah came Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon unto Jerusalem, and besieged it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Lord gave Jehoiakim king of Judah into his hand, with part of the vessels of the house of God: which he carried into the land of Shinar to the house of his god; and he brought the vessels into the treasure house of his god.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the king spake unto Ashpenaz the master of his eunuchs, that he should bring",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "certain",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the children of Israel, and of the king's seed, and of the princes;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Children in whom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.1.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.1.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no blemish, but well favoured, and skilful in all wisdom, and cunning in knowledge, and understanding science, and such as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "had",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.1.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.1.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ability in them to stand in the king's palace, and whom they might teach the learning and the tongue of the Chaldeans.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the king appointed them a daily provision of the king's meat, and of the wine which he drank: so nourishing them three years, that at the end thereof they might stand before the king.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now among these were of the children of Judah, Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unto whom the prince of the eunuchs gave names: for he gave unto Daniel",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the name",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of Belteshazzar; and to Hananiah, of Shadrach; and to Mishael, of Meshach; and to Azariah, of Abed-nego.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ But Daniel purposed in his heart that he would not defile himself with the portion of the king's meat, nor with the wine which he drank: therefore he requested of the prince of the eunuchs that he might not defile himself.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now God had brought Daniel into favour and tender love with the prince of the eunuchs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the prince of the eunuchs said unto Daniel, I fear my lord the king, who hath appointed your meat and your drink: for why should he see your faces worse liking than the children which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of your sort? then shall ye make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "me",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "endanger my head to the king.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said Daniel to Melzar, whom the prince of the eunuchs had set over Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Prove thy servants, I beseech thee, ten days; and let them give us pulse to eat, and water to drink.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then let our countenances be looked upon before thee, and the countenance of the children that eat of the portion of the king's meat: and as thou seest, deal with thy servants.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he consented to them in this matter, and proved them ten days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And at the end of ten days their countenances appeared fairer and fatter in flesh than all the children which did eat the portion of the king's meat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus Melzar took away the portion of their meat, and the wine that they should drink; and gave them pulse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ As for these four children, God gave them knowledge and skill in all learning and wisdom: and Daniel had understanding in all visions and dreams.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now at the end of the days that the king had said he should bring them in, then the prince of the eunuchs brought them in before Nebuchadnezzar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the king communed with them; and among them all was found none like Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah: therefore stood they before the king.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And in all matters of wisdom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.1.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.1.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "understanding, that the king enquired of them, he found them ten times better than all the magicians",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.1.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.1.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "astrologers that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.1.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.1.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in all his realm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Daniel continued",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.1.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.1.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto the first year of king Cyrus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "DAN.2",
    "number": "2",
